    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, i've heard a lot about greece and rome. but what about other places? like, during the middle ages or something, were there any other major civilizations that were doing big things in science or law while europe was kind of in the dark ages? i want to make sure my paper isn't just looking at one side of the world.",
