      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's cool, i didn't realize they were that far ahead. i was reading something about how some of these empires, like in africa or the middle east, were super advanced but people usually don't talk about them in school. do you think those cultures had as much of an impact on the actual *structure* of modern government and law as the western ones did, or were they more just focused on stuff like math and tech? like, did they influence how we run countries today at all?",
